.nh
.TH containers-storage-get-layer-data 1 "December 2020"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
containers-storage-get-layer-data \- Retrieve lookaside data for a layer

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBcontainers-storage\fP \fBget-layer-data\fP [\fIoptions\fP [...]] \fIlayerID\fP \fIdataName\fP

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Retrieves a piece of named data which is associated with a layer.

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB-f | --file\fP \fIfile\fP

.PP
Write the data to a file instead of stdout.

.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
containers-storage get-layer-data -f config.json \\
 2cf24dba5fb0a30e26e83b2ac5b9e29e1b161e5c1fa7425e73043362938b9824 \\
 configuration
.EE

.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
containers-storage-set-layer-data(1)
